@token = paste-the-accessToken-from-login-here

### Sign up (returns a token straight away)
POST http://localhost:5097/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "nima@example.com",
    "password": "SuperSecret123"
}

### Log in
POST http://localhost:5097/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "nima@example.com",
    "password": "SuperSecret123"
}

### Who am I (requires a token)
GET http://localhost:5097/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

